        </profile>
      <profile id="112555e9-c1c8-43d7-a487-5d78a136ef26" name="Commander Embarkation" hidden="false" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Choose exactly one Fleet Commander. This character is embarked aboard this Flagship.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="4ff76483-6152-4bdc-a5fb-eae123ab7f9c" name="Retinue Eligibility" hidden="false" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">The Primarch Retinue slot may only be used when the Primarch is selected as this ship's Fleet Commander. Choose at most one named Character of the same Legion.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="7f50ac47-f930-44bd-873f-3afd794a15d8" name="Roster Builder Summary" hidden="false" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Crew 12. Ships start unequipped. Fill only the weapon and Defence hardpoints you want to purchase; each may contain at most one component. Hangar Bay slots cost 0 pts. Aircraft are purchased separately up to Hangar capacity.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles>
